text:
@5Solas “Theology is queen of the sciences and philosophy is her handmaiden.”
That’s the foundational framework Western Christian universities were founded on.
The Reformers used the tools of ancient philosophers (i.e. logic) to inform their hermeneutics and apologetics.

text_completo:
@5Solas “Theology is queen of the sciences and philosophy is her handmaiden.”
That’s the foundational framework Western Christian universities were founded on.
The Reformers used the tools of ancient philosophers (i.e. logic) to inform their hermeneutics and apologetics.

traducción:
@5Solas “La teología es la reina de las ciencias y la filosofía es su sirvienta.”
Ese es el marco fundamental sobre el que se fundaron las universidades cristianas occidentales.
Los reformadores usaron las herramientas de los filósofos antiguos (es decir, la lógica) para informar su hermenéutica y apologética.

