text:
@not_our_guy @The_Jaded_Geek @TheoWarsPodcast Aramaic was the common language in Christ’s time. Ancient Hebrew, like Latin in late medieval times, was relegated to clerical and academic endeavors.
Calling Jesus “Yeshua” is like calling John Calvin “Iohannes”.
The Yeshua “cult” thinks Hebrew transliteration = piety.

